cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "lambda-rfi-mitigation: eigen-subspace RFI mitigation with directional protection for the LAMBDA array"
abstract: >-
  Offline RFI-mitigation and imaging code for the LAMBDA 36-element radio
  interferometer, together with the notebook that regenerates every figure in
  the paper. Short-term visibility covariances are peeled of a scaled Haslam sky
  prior, whitened, projected free of a fixed-rank interference subspace while
  protecting chosen directions (the Sun), and imaged by direct DFT.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
